$MDESC::Type = "Tribes Arena";
$MDESC::Text = "<s3><f1>Mission Type: <f0> Arena" @
         "\n<f1>Planet: <f0> Orbitting Avicord's Planet" @
         "\n<f1>Weather: <f0> Clear" @
         "\n<f1>Time of Day: <f0> Night" @
         "\n<f1># of Teams: <f0> 2" @
         "\n\n<f1>Briefing:<f0> The <vServer::teamName0> and <vServer::teamName1> are fighting for control of a space station that orbits Avicord's Planet.  " @
         "This is a do or die mission for each team.  The space station must be captured at all costs and because of the limited amount of fighting space, this is potentialy the most dangerous mission you could embark on.  Destroy the enemy completely and capture the crippled station.  Below looms the planet so one wrong move could mean your death in this battle.";

